  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under AU-C 560.14 and the AICPA Code, a CPA who discovers a material error in previously issued financial statements must notify the former client and recommend corrective action, even after the professional relationship has ended. If the client refuses, the CPA should evaluate further steps including notifying relying parties.
