  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under the AICPA Code of Professional Conduct (ET 1.700.001) and IRC Section 7216, client information is confidential. A CPA should not disclose tax return information without the client''s consent unless compelled by a valid subpoena or summons. A general agency request without legal compulsion is insufficient.
